s5-art 2026-11-26: impostor_w.png = Among Us' classic red crewmate (the old design the video's piece uses; every video crop has the kill hand over its right side), from Among Us Wiki File:Red_old_design.png (148x198, https://among-us.fandom.com/wiki/File:Red_old_design.png), re-traced on its own flat palette to 512 px at 90% (tools/art_s5_impostor.py). (c) Innersloth, fan use.
